data: {"trace_id": "tr_70c98457b0bf413b", "seq": 7, "ts": 1794252150876, "elapsed_ms": 1432.2, "count": 6, "chunks": [{"index": 1, "chunk_id": "9e5cb0a0-4067-343f-7c46-c43632f4051f", "arxiv_id": "2106.09685", "title": "LoRA: Low-Rank Adaptation of Large Language Models", "page": 1, "kind": "paragraph", "score": 0.8914, "rerank_score": 0.9029, "hit_source": "rerank", "has_anchors": false, "preview": "LORA: LOW-RANK ADAPTATION OF LARGE LAN- GUAGE MODELS Edward Hu∗ Yelong Shen∗ Phillip Wallis Zeyuan Allen-Zhu Yuanzhi Li Shean Wang Lu Wang Weizhu Chen Microsoft"}, {"index": 2, "chunk_id": "7af26703-79bb-ad27-1e11-b71fe394e004", "arxiv_id": "2010.11929", "title": "An Image is Worth 16x16 Words: Transformers for Image Recognition at Scale", "page": 2, "kind": "paragraph", "score": 0.8726, "rerank_score": 0.3632, "hit_source": "rerank", "has_anchors": false, "preview": "Published as a conference paper at ICLR 2021 inherent to CNNs, such as translation equivariance and locality, and therefore do not generalize well when trained "}, {"index": 3, "chunk_id": "chk_fef1d1451fb942f1", "arxiv_id": "upload_bdfaa68d8984f0dc", "title": "Attention is All You Need论文.pdf", "page": 0, "kind": "reference", "score": 0.8286, "rerank_score": 1.0, "hit_source": "rerank", "has_anchors": false, "preview": "Exploring the limits of language modeling ['Rafal Jozefowicz', 'Oriol Vinyals', 'Mike Schuster', 'Noam Shazeer', 'Yonghui Wu'] 2016"}, {"index": 4, "chunk_id": "885e73fd-0705-b183-1741-fccd6b41dbfd", "arxiv_id": "1810.04805", "title": "BERT: Pre-training of Deep Bidirectional Transformers for Language Understanding", "page": 2, "kind": "paragraph", "score": 0.8242, "rerank_score": 0.5896, "hit_source": "rerank", "has_anchors": false, "preview": "word based only on its context. Unlike left-to- right language model pre-training, the MLM ob- jective enables the representation to fuse the left and the right"}, {"index": 5, "chunk_id": "dafc9588-ffd4-a45f-7e89-ade6e6273ca3", "arxiv_id": "2106.09685", "title": "LoRA: Low-Rank Adaptation of Large Language Models", "page": 3, "kind": "paragraph", "score": 0.8129, "rerank_score": 0.4838, "hit_source": "rerank", "has_anchors": false, "preview": "During full ﬁne-tuning, the model is initialized to pre-trained weights Φ0 and updated to Φ0 + ∆Φ by repeatedly following the gradient to maximize the condition"}, {"index": 6, "chunk_id": "chk_12fa20f0918e445d", "arxiv_id": "upload_bdfaa68d8984f0dc", "title": "Attention is All You Need论文.pdf", "page": 2, "kind": "paragraph", "score": 0.8111, "rerank_score": 0.7311, "hit_source": "rerank", "has_anchors": true, "preview": "1 Introduction Recurrent neural networks, long short-term memory [13] and gated recurrent [7] neural networks in particular, have been firmly established as sta"}], "top_raw_score": 0.030777, "reject_threshold": 0.03, "type": "generic", "papers": 4, "strategy": "分流前行为：dense + sparse + RRF（兜底）"}

